# hello_exec manifest — Uros #235 pilot.
#
# hello_exec is the canonical exec_server smoke binary: bare _start
# that walks the AUXV and loops on mach_null.  It never calls
# cap_request, so the legitimate cap set is empty — same situation
# as hello_server.  Any cap_request from this task should come back
# as CAP_ERR_NOT_IN_MANIFEST under v2.1 enforcement.

name hello_exec

# No `required` lines.
# No `delegatable` lines.
